{"title":"지켜줘 루나이트","artist":"히메모리 루나","sourceId":"reference:z7tsAGjwEwqXeuSxhBhQ","sourceHash":"a48f6213c69286e21d7cf61f9dbc2c6f67c5098aa0e07adbe0559b4bd2a9e296","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.96,"end":4.44,"text":"跪きなさい。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.44,"end":7.44,"text":"汝、この城の扉を叩いた者よ。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":9.49,"end":11.24,"text":"誓いなさい。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":11.24,"end":14.24,"text":"このルーナの盾となり矛となり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":15.52,"end":18.52,"text":"夜はぐっすり眠れるまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":18.85,"end":21.85,"text":"ともにあることを！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":24.71,"end":27.71,"text":"捧げなさい！ 姫であるぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":37.49,"end":38.87,"text":"止まるのら！ ルーナって？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":38.87,"end":41.32,"text":"「紅茶のカップかちゃかちゃ鳴らさないってえらい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":41.32,"end":44.14,"text":"「スコーンだってこぼさず綺麗に食べてすごい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":44.14,"end":46.93,"text":"「たまーに王冠どっちが前か間違っちゃうのかわいい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":46.93,"end":49.71,"text":"通ってよし！なのら 開城～！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.71,"end":52.69,"text":"ルーナイト第一条！ 誰よりルーナが好きな人！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":52.69,"end":55.31,"text":"ルーナイト第二条！ シルクのお布団持ってきて！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":55.31,"end":58.24,"text":"ルーナイト第三条！ 三時のお茶会来れる人！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":58.24,"end":61.24,"text":"守れなかったら即・制裁！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":61.38,"end":64.36,"text":"分かってほしいのら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":64.36,"end":67.12,"text":"これも、帝王学を学ぶため","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":67.12,"end":70.12,"text":"愛という名の... 教育なのら～！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":72.22,"end":73.19,"text":"守護ってルーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":73.19,"end":74.78999999999999,"text":"想ってくんないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":74.78999999999999,"end":77.31,"text":"プロムナード ボイコットなのなのら！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":77.31,"end":80.24,"text":"手の甲に忠誠 誓えるの？Chu","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":80.24,"end":83.16,"text":"ガラスの靴 履かせてワルツ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":83.16,"end":84.47,"text":"守護ってルーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":84.47,"end":85.9,"text":"かまってくんないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":85.9,"end":88.9,"text":"ブラウニーにキャンディー どれだけあってもね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":89.12,"end":91.28999999999999,"text":"君がいなきゃだって！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":91.28999999999999,"end":94.28999999999999,"text":"みんな 心して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":94.39,"end":97.39,"text":"捧げなさい！ 姫であるぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":105.46000000000001,"end":106.84,"text":"ルーナって？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":106.84,"end":109.84,"text":"「お菓子のあと ちゃんと歯磨きするの えらい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":110.53999999999999,"end":113.53999999999999,"text":"「目覚ましなくたって 起きられちゃうの すごい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":114.74000000000001,"end":117.74000000000001,"text":"「ステップこんがらがっちゃったのも かわいい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":119.18,"end":122.18,"text":"今日の誉め言葉、よし！なのら 開城～！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":123.36,"end":126.36,"text":"ルーナイト第四条！ ルーナを本気にさせる人！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":126.6,"end":129.39,"text":"ルーナイト第五条！ ダイヤの花とか摘んできて！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":129.39,"end":132.13,"text":"ルーナイト第六条！ ドラゴンペットに出来る人！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":132.13,"end":135.13,"text":"つべこべ言わずに即・実行！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":135.67,"end":138.5,"text":"きっと分かってくれるのら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":138.5,"end":140.68,"text":"君主論だって読んだのら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":140.68,"end":143.68,"text":"恋はいつだって... 試練なのら～！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":145.99,"end":147.11,"text":"守護ってルーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":147.11,"end":148.68,"text":"踊ってくんないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":148.68,"end":151.31,"text":"オペラハウス 貸し切りなのなのら！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":151.31,"end":154.25,"text":"貫いて忠誠 約束のChu","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":154.25,"end":157.15,"text":"ドレスの薔薇 咲かせてロンド！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":157.15,"end":158.36,"text":"守護ってルーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":158.36,"end":159.88,"text":"わかってくんないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":159.88,"end":162.88,"text":"バルコニー レモンティー 月にシュガー乗せちゃう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":162.88,"end":165.04,"text":"あの子も綺麗だって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":165.04,"end":168.04,"text":"そんな たわ言は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":168.27,"end":171.27,"text":"おやめなさい！ 姫であるぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":182.28,"end":183.58,"text":"守護ってルーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":183.58,"end":184.93,"text":"想ってくんないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":184.93,"end":187.64,"text":"プロムナード ボイコットなのなのら！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":187.64,"end":190.59,"text":"永遠の忠誠 この指にChu","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":190.59,"end":193.37,"text":"ガラスの靴 履かせてワルツ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":193.37,"end":194.63,"text":"守護ってルーナイト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":194.63,"end":196.17000000000002,"text":"かまってくんないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":196.17000000000002,"end":199.17000000000002,"text":"ブラウニーにキャンディー どれだけあってもね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":199.53,"end":201.36,"text":"君がいなきゃだって！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":201.36,"end":204.36,"text":"みんな 心して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":204.51,"end":207.51,"text":"捧げなさい！ 姫であるぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}